<title>BELGIUM: TABLE - Belgian non-comp auction raises 7.7 bln bfr.</title>
<headline>TABLE - Belgian non-comp auction raises 7.7 bln bfr.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-07-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Belgian Treasury details of the outcome of its monthly government non-competitive bond auction:</p>
<p>6.25 pct, March 2007 OLO 26</p>
<p>    Payment date				  31/07</p>
<p>    Lowest accepted (stop) price	    104.20</p>
<p>    Amount allotted				10.035 billion francs</p>
<p>    Percentage taken at stop		  48.1</p>
<p>    Avg weighted price / yield		104.212 / 5.667 pct</p>
<p>    Amount allotted at non-comp auction     3.940 billion francs</p>
<p>7.25 pct, April 2004 OLO 14</p>
<p>    Payment date				  31/07</p>
<p>    Lowest accepted (stop) price	    111.40</p>
<p>    Amount allotted				13.020 billion</p>
<p>    Percentage taken at stop		  48.4</p>
<p>    Avg weighted price / yield		111.404 / 5.197 pct</p>
<p>    Amount allotted at non-comp auction     3.730 billion francs</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6810, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
</text>
